note ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
note This file is a specification illustration. It uses record declarations,
note abilities and control flow, which the single file reference front end does
note not implement yet (see spec/15 section 15.8). Programs that the reference
note can compile today are hello.shark, tour*.shark, pages.shark and ambiguity.shark.
note ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

note A social application. One language for interface, logic, storage and server.

use ui
use store
use net

a person has
  name as text
  bio as text starting at
  avatar as an image

the collection people holds person
  indexed by name unique

a post has
  author as a person
  body as text
  posted at as a moment

the collection posts holds post
  indexed by author

keep current user as nothing

note --------------------------------------------------------------- interface

page Profile
  in a column spaced 12
    show picture avatar of current user described as Profile photo
    show text name of current user
    show text bio of current user
    show button Follow named follow

    show divider

    show list of every row in posts where author of it is current user
      showing each as
        in a column spaced 4
          show text body of it
          show text posted at of it

  when follow is pressed
    follow current user
    change button follow to Following

note --------------------------------------------------------------- behaviour

to notice a user posts something
  give an event

when user posts something
  all at once
    put a post with
      author as current user
      body as the new body
      posted at as now
    into posts

  show post to followers of current user

note --------------------------------------------------------------- the server

serve on port 8080
  when a request arrives at /feed isolated
    let recent be every row in posts
      sorted by posted at of it
      limited to 50
    reply with json recent

  when a request arrives at /health isolated
    reply with text
      ok

note ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
note There is no SQL here, and there cannot be: the `where` block is ordinary
note Shark that the compiler analyses at build time to choose an index. String
note interpolation into a query is not expressible, so injection is not a class
note of bug this program can have.
